WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.202
-Thank you, everybody,
for tuning in

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.203
and watching "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.237
I appreciate it.

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:06.005
Let's get to the news
and jokes.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:08.708
Well, guys, today
is September 17th.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.276
I point that out
'cause, once again,

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:13.146
President Trump has contradicted
one of his medical experts.

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:15.248
I didn't want you to think
tonight's show was a rerun.

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:18.684
That's right, yesterday,
the director of the CDC,

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:21.354
Robert Redfield,
testified before Congress,

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.122
and he was asked
when a COVID vaccine

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:24.790
would be available
to the public.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:26.192
Here's what he said.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.127
-If you're asking me, when is it
gonna be generally available

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:30.263
to the American public

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:33.433
so we can begin
to take advantage of vaccine

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:36.002
to get back to our regular life,

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:40.373
I think we're probably looking
at third -- late second quarter,

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:43.443
third quarter 2021.

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:46.413
-Trump's staff saw that
and was like,

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.814
"Better put on
another pot of coffee.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:49.782
It's gonna be a long one
tonight."

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:52.185
Meanwhile, Americans looked at
their sweatpants and were like,

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:54.254
"Guess it's gonna be me and you,
buddy, for a little
while longer.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:55.855
Here we go."

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.657
Let me put this in perspective
for the Netflix generation.

00:00:58.657 --> 00:01:00.993
By the time there's a vaccine,
the students at Cobra Kai

00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:03.029
will be older than Mr. Miyagi.

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:06.332
Later that day, Trump was asked

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.101
about Redfield's
vaccine comments.

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.435
And check out what he said.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:11.271
-I think he made a mistake
when he said that.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.873
It's just incorrect information.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:17.043
And I called him,
and he didn't tell me that,

00:01:17.043 --> 00:01:19.546
and I think he got the message,
maybe, confused.

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:22.215
-He got the message
maybe confused.

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:25.017
Man, could Trump sound
any more like a mob boss?

00:01:25.017 --> 00:01:28.688
"Yeah, this guy Redfield,
maybe he don't know so good.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.256
Capisce?"

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:32.958
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:35.295
Next he's gonna send Eric
and Don Jr. with baseball bats

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:36.796
down to the CDC.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:39.032
"It looks like you,
uh, misremembered,

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:42.735
and maybe we can help
jog your memory."

00:01:46.138 --> 00:01:48.140
The head of the CDC
was confused.

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.442
Trump was like, "The vaccine
is right around the corner,

00:01:50.442 --> 00:01:53.713
according to my experts Chuck
Woolery and the My Pillow guy."

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:58.084
You know, as we speak,
Dr. Redfield is being led

00:01:58.084 --> 00:02:00.553
into the White House basement,
where there's just
a pullout couch

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:02.521
and Dr. Fauci.

00:02:02.521 --> 00:02:04.390
At the same press conference,

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.025
Trump said something
pretty shocking

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.394
about the number of COVID cases
in the United States.

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:09.495
Listen to this.

00:02:09.495 --> 00:02:10.997
-If you take
the blue states out,

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:13.566
we're at a level

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:16.268
that I don't think anybody
in the world would be at.

00:02:16.268 --> 00:02:20.673
-"Also, if you don't count the
racial tension and the economy,

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.675
it's been a pretty smooth
six months.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.610
Wouldn't you say?"

00:02:25.744 --> 00:02:28.514
Then Trump was like, "And if you
also take out the red states,

00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:30.015
boom, we have no cases at all.

00:02:30.015 --> 00:02:31.985
So, basically, no virus."

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:34.554
You can't just not count
certain states.

00:02:34.554 --> 00:02:36.122
That's like eating a salad
for lunch,

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.890
a cheeseburger for dinner,
then saying,

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.959
"If you don't count the burger,
I'm vegan."

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.728
All this COVID stuff
is so depressing.

00:02:42.728 --> 00:02:44.597
Do we have any lighter
Trump news?

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.799
-CNN has learned
the Trump administration

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:48.901
considered using a heat ray

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:51.804
against protesters
in Lafayette Park back in June.

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:54.974
The heat ray makes people feel
like their skin is on fire.

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.111
-I'm sorry, what? A heat ray?

00:02:59.111 --> 00:03:02.414
Who are his advisors,
a bunch of minions stacked
on top of each other?

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:06.786
Even Kim Jong-un was like,
"That's pretty messed up, dude."

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:08.621
A heat ray. Apparently,
Trump ripped out a page

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:11.257
of an X-Men comic and was like,
"This."

00:03:13.859 --> 00:03:15.294
But despite everything
that's going on,

00:03:15.294 --> 00:03:16.962
Trump spent the morning
complaining about

00:03:16.962 --> 00:03:18.831
Twitter's trending page.

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:21.400
Yeah, he believes trends
are rigged against him.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:23.970
I don't know about that,
but I do think that, sometimes,

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.938
seeing a hashtag doesn't
tell the whole story.

00:03:25.938 --> 00:03:28.241
So, we decided to take a look
at what's trending

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:29.742
and, more importantly, why.

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:30.843
I'll show you what I mean.

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:33.446
First up, Snuffleupagus
was trending.

00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:35.548
You may think it's 'cause of
"Sesame Street's"

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:37.149
"Back to School" town hall.

00:03:37.149 --> 00:03:38.918
But Snuffleupagus
is actually trending

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:42.321
'cause it's how Trump kept
pronouncing "Stephanopoulos."

00:03:42.321 --> 00:03:45.892
Next up, cocaine was trending.

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.593
You may think it's 'cause
a cocaine ring

00:03:47.593 --> 00:03:48.928
was busted in Brooklyn.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:51.030
But cocaine is actually trending
'cause

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.898
it's what Red Lobster uses
for the salt rim

00:03:52.898 --> 00:03:54.801
on their Dew-Garita.

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.703
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.404 --> 00:04:00.806
Up next, Emergen-C was trending.

00:04:00.806 --> 00:04:03.809
You may think it's 'cause people
are preparing for a second wave.

00:04:03.809 --> 00:04:05.845
But Emergen-C is actually
trending 'cause

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:08.581
it's what Trump's been using as
makeup since the virus started.

00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:16.555
And, finally, 10.9 inches
was trending.

00:04:16.555 --> 00:04:18.023
And you may think it's 'cause
it's the size

00:04:18.023 --> 00:04:19.725
of Apple's new iPad.

00:04:19.725 --> 00:04:22.795
But 10.9 inches is actually
trending 'cause of Chris Evans.

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:24.096
That --

00:04:24.096 --> 00:04:26.132
I didn't even know --
I didn't even get to --

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:27.900
[ Cymbal crashes ]

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.202
[ Chuckles ]

00:04:30.202 --> 00:04:33.138
"Maybe I could jog your memory
a bit."

00:04:33.138 --> 00:04:35.207
Toothpick.

00:04:35.207 --> 00:04:36.609
-No.

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:40.379
-Check this out. Today, there's
a pretty big announcement

00:04:40.379 --> 00:04:42.415
from President Obama.
Listen to this.

00:04:42.415 --> 00:04:44.851
-Former President Barack Obama
this morning announcing

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:47.920
that he will be releasing
his Presidential memoir.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.755
It will come in not one
but two parts.

00:04:49.755 --> 00:04:52.091
The first volume,
"A Promised Land,"

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:55.428
will hit bookshelves on
Tuesday, November 17th.

00:04:55.428 --> 00:04:58.197
-Yeah, "A Promised Land"
is the first of two volumes.

00:04:58.197 --> 00:05:00.432
And get this -- volume one,
this is real --

00:05:00.432 --> 00:05:03.102
is 768 pages.

00:05:03.102 --> 00:05:04.570
Wow.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.006
Meanwhile, Trump already claimed
he read both volumes last night

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:08.907
and it was "boring."

00:05:08.907 --> 00:05:10.509
768 pages.

00:05:10.509 --> 00:05:13.279
That's not a coffee table book.
That's a coffee table.

00:05:15.515 --> 00:05:20.286
768 pages. That's like my new
book plus another 760 pages.

00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:22.255
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:27.026
I actually plan
on buying both volumes

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:30.463
just in case I ever need to
block myself from a heat ray.

00:05:34.466 --> 00:05:37.003
The heat ray!

00:05:39.605 --> 00:05:41.440
This is interesting.
I saw that Amazon

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.875
has launched a new invite-only
section of its site

00:05:43.875 --> 00:05:46.044
called Luxury Stores.

00:05:46.044 --> 00:05:49.982
That's nice. Now you can order
a $5,000 Oscar de la Renta gown

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:52.118
and then have the package
hurled over your fence.

00:05:53.785 --> 00:05:56.055
Yeah, it's about time
you can order a designer dress

00:05:56.055 --> 00:05:57.990
that comes in the same box
as your Ragu sauce

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.826
and Lucky Charms.

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:01.961
And finally, a bus passenger
in the U.K. --

00:06:01.961 --> 00:06:04.530
did you see this -- he came up
with a pretty interesting way

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:05.998
of protecting himself
from the virus.

00:06:05.998 --> 00:06:06.999
Watch this.

00:06:06.999 --> 00:06:08.301
-In other news, a man in England

00:06:08.301 --> 00:06:10.203
was spotted on a public bus

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:13.005
using a live snake
wrapped around his head

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:14.674
as a COVID facemask.

00:06:16.775 --> 00:06:18.144
-Meanwhile,
the guy was screaming,

00:06:18.144 --> 00:06:19.344
"Somebody help me.

00:06:19.344 --> 00:06:21.614
Help! Help me!"

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:24.583
You know someone's on Facebook
still like,

00:06:24.583 --> 00:06:26.218
"You know, you got to use
the snake to cover your mouth

00:06:26.218 --> 00:06:27.653
and your nose."

00:06:29.321 --> 00:06:32.258
Unfortunately, chaos erupted
when another guy put a mouse on

00:06:32.258 --> 00:06:33.359
as a facemask.

